PREAMBLE

This license governs the use, reproduction, modification, distribution,
and commercialization of the concept known as the "Asymmetric Hydraulic
Pendulum Wheel" (AHPW) and all related mechanical principles, designs,
simulations, documentation, and derivative works contained in or derived
from this repository.

The inventor, Mustafa Sayed Sharif, believes that knowledge should be
freely shared for the benefit of humanity. This license is designed to
maximize open access while protecting against exploitation, harm, and
unauthorized commercial gain.

━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

SECTION 1 — DEFINITIONS

1.1 "The Concept" refers to the Asymmetric Hydraulic Pendulum Wheel
    (AHPW) mechanical principle, including but not limited to: the
    Z-piston fluid redistribution mechanism, the multi-unit dead-point
    elimination architecture, and any mechanical arrangement that
    achieves sustained gravitational torque asymmetry through piston-
    driven fluid redistribution on a rotating wheel.

1.2 "The Work" refers to all files, documents, code, simulations,
    diagrams, papers, and other materials in this repository.

1.3 "Derivative Work" refers to any mechanical design, product, system,
    simulation, publication, or other work that is based on, inspired by,
    or derived from The Concept or The Work.

1.4 "Commercial Use" means any use, direct or indirect, that generates
    financial benefit, including but not limited to: selling products or
    services based on The Concept, licensing The Concept or Derivative
    Works to third parties, using The Concept in revenue-generating
    activities, or profiting from The Concept's effects or outcomes.

1.5 "The Inventor" means Mustafa Sayed Sharif or, in the event of his
    death, his legal heirs and designated representatives.

1.6 "Peaceful Use" means any application that does not cause direct or
    indirect harm to human beings, animals, or the environment.

